    "detailed_description": "Turn-based traditional RPG in a low fantasy setting. <br />\r\nGrind mobs for gold and gear in a setting based on old Finnish mythology, then upgrade your party to advance to stronger areas.<br />\r\nDefeat monsters, then invest gold in stores to upgrade your characters to be able to defeat stronger monsters.<br />\r\nZero instances of downtime between player inputs and gameplay for the entire duration of the game, optimal for casual play as well as speedrunning.<br />\r\nFully playable with Controllers and Steam Deck.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreated by a single developer on a shoe-string budget.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll source code available under AGPL license at:<br />\r\nhttps://github.com/anttijuo/CrowningReverie",
